o</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Padmanabhan</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Oh</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immortalized feeders for the scale-up of human embryonic stem cells in feeder and feeder-free conditions</article-title><source>J Biotechnol</source><year>2006</year><volume>122</volume><fpage>130</fpage><lpage>141</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16233925</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jbiotec.2005.09.008</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koivisto</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hyv&#x000e4;rinen</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Str&#x000f6;mberg</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Inzunza</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Matilainen</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Mikkola</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hovatta</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Teerijoki</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cultures of human embryonic stem cells - serum replacement medium or serum-containing media and the effect of basic fibrolast growth factor</article-title><source>Reproductive BioMedicine Online</source><year>2004</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>337</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15353086</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Chip-man Technologies Ltd</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.chipmantech.com"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>